<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@/~cl_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@/~cl_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Excise (Amendment) Act 2001. Amendment of section 42"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@/~cl_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Excise Act 1976 [Act 176], which in this Act is referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended in paragraph 42(2)(a) by substituting for the words \"firm or association of persons\" the words \"a firm, a society, an association or other body of persons\". New section 53A"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@/~cl_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 53 the following section: \" Access to 53A. (1) Any officer of excise exercising his powers recorded under sections 51, 52 and 53 shall be given access to any informa- tion or recorded information or computerised data, whether stored compute- in a computer or otherwise. rised data. (2) In addition, an officer of excise exercising his powers under sections 51, 52 and 53— (a) may inspect and check the operation of any computer and any associated apparatus or material which he has reasonable cause to suspect is or has been used in connection with that information or data; and (b) may require— (i) the person by whom or on whose behalf the officer of excise has reasonable cause to suspect the computer is or has been so used; or (ii) the person having charge of, or is otherwise concerned with, the operation of the computer, apparatus or material, to provide him with such reasonable assistance as he may require for the purposes of this section. (3) For the purposes of subsection (1), \"access\" includes being provided with the necessary password, encryption code, decryption code, software or hardware and any other means required to enable comprehension of recorded information or computerised data.\". Amendment of section 55"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@/~cl_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@/~cl_4__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/13/eng@> .
